{
  "name": "Occult Association: Shaman (Tier 1)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "category": "technique",
    "source": {
      "revision": 1,
      "rules": "2024",
      "book": ""
    },
    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 1 — Shaman</strong></p><p><strong>“It was talking before. You just couldn’t hear it yet.”</strong></p><p>At Tier 1, you become perceptible to the world and the world becomes perceptible to you.</p><p>You can feel when a place is hungry, when a storm is about to turn mean, and when a Hex is carrying more pressure than its surface suggests. You are not commanding Lore yet. You are learning its tone.</p><p><strong>Tactical (Character Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>Gain a skill rank in <strong>Lore</strong> and <strong>Athletics</strong></li><li>You can perform a brief attunement to sense whether a nearby area is spiritually calm, distressed, corrupted, or unusually resonant</li></ul><p><strong>Strategic (Faction Scale)</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Hex Attunement:</strong> upon entering a new Hex, you learn one of the following about it: dominant flow-state, unusual weather pressure, leyline disturbance, or corruption presence</li><li>Once per Strategic Turn, gain <strong>+1</strong> to one relevant travel, terrain, or wilderness-facing OP roll</li></ul><p><strong>Cost:</strong> once the world starts speaking to you, silence gets rare. Expect distraction, omen pressure, or spirit agitation when your faction ignores what a place is telling you.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"shamT1\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Hex Attunement</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Strategic Turn &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Strategic &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">+1 to one travel/terrain/wilderness OP roll. (On-entry hex read is passive.)</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
